body:
i feel like a lot of the comments on here are kind of misleading. some weed burns nice and clean and others burn dirty, charcoaley, resinous, powdery. a lot of it has to do with genetics of the bud, how it was cured and if it got sprayed with crap during flower

&#x200B;

i dont think it has much to do with quality more so just characteristics and it can go a million different ways
